.
.  Generate sample output for Uniform Cumulative Hazard plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na unicha.ps
device 2 postscript
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE Uniform Cumulative Hazard
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
TIC LABEL SIZE 3
Y1LABEL Cumulative Hazard
X1LABEL X
.
PLOT UNICHAZ(X) FOR X = 0 0.01 0.99
.
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system cp UNICHA.PS unicha.ps
system rm UNICHA.PS
.
quit
